## Day 3 — Understanding pLDDT

- Reviewed the meaning of pLDDT in AlphaFold.
- Learned that pLDDT ranges from 0 to 100 and represents predicted local structural confidence.
- Documented the relationship between pLDDT values and AlphaFold colour coding.
- Observed that the HBB model was predominantly blue, indicating high predicted local confidence across much of the structure.
- Noted that pLDDT is not a direct measure of protein function, disease, disorder, or stability.
